<title>SOUTH KOREA: Ssangyong Oil closes CDU for maintenance.</title>
<headline>Ssangyong Oil closes CDU for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Oil Refining Co, a unit of Ssangyong Group, said it had closed down its No 1 crude distillation unit (CDU) on Wednesday for annual maintenance.</p>
<p>The 93,000 barrels-per-day (bpd) CDU will be back up on June 23, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Ssangyong, South Korea's third largest oil refiner in terms of capacity, has refining capability of 443,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
